# Only the website (www/) and the install script it serves go into the build
# context of www/Dockerfile; the Go sources and everything built or installed
# locally stay out.
*
!install.sh
!www
www/Dockerfile
www/**/node_modules
www/**/dist
www/**/.astro
www/**/.blume
www/**/.env
www/**/.env.*
!www/**/.env.schema
